Main Objective : 

Bring everything together. Build a fully responsive landing page using both Grid and Flexbox in the right places.

What You Will Implement : 

Choose a reference landing page and recreate it.

Phase 1 : HTML skeleton + base desktop styles. This must be a commit in your history.

Phase 2 (final):

-> Flexbox for: navbar, buttons, card content, footer links.
-> Grid for: page layout, services/features area, gallery.
-> Responsive: at least 2 breakpoints (tablet and mobile).
-> Semantic HTML, CSS variables, meaningful alt text, meta tags.
-> A hamburger or stacked menu on mobile (a simple stacked version is fine).
